title: "Brain Tumor Classification from MRI Using Deep Learning and Explainable AI"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mirani
    given-names: Palwisha
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research implementation for four-class brain MRI image
  classification with leakage-controlled splitting, EfficientNet-B0,
  held-out evaluation, Grad-CAM, and a Streamlit demonstration.
keywords:
  - medical imaging
  - brain MRI
  - deep learning
  - explainable AI
  - Grad-CAM
